{"id":"f056ea86f9505c97","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-friedberg-muchnik-stages.md","title":"Deterministic Finite-Injury Stages","display":"df-friedberg-muchnik-stages — Deterministic Finite-Injury Stages","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-friedberg-muchnik-stages","aliases":["68-df-friedberg-muchnik-stages"],"display":"df-friedberg-muchnik-stages — Deterministic Finite-Injury Stages","depends_on":["[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]","[[68-df-oracle-computation]]","[[68-df-finite-use-preservation]]","[[68-df-recursive-set]]"],"source_location":"local formalization of the supplied archive; no source PDF supplied","verification_status":"local-definition-reviewed","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","revision_basis":"supplied-68(2).zip; necessary internal construction interface"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-friedberg-muchnik-stages"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-friedberg-muchnik-stages</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-friedberg-muchnik-stages — Deterministic Finite-Injury Stages"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c524671590651be2\" href=\"?note=c524671590651be2\" title=\"68-df-number-theoretic-function\">68-df-number-theoretic-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"124259d2584af1b6\" href=\"?note=124259d2584af1b6\" title=\"68-df-oracle-computation\">68-df-oracle-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"31939e9d65c515ab\" href=\"?note=31939e9d65c515ab\" title=\"68-df-finite-use-preservation\">68-df-finite-use-preservation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7fc8baae87b873a3\" href=\"?note=7fc8baae87b873a3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-set\">68-df-recursive-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"local formalization of the supplied archive; no source PDF supplied"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-definition-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68(2).zip; necessary internal construction interface"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,i,x\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(s,i,x\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(k\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。有限序列及连接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c524671590651be2\" href=\"?note=c524671590651be2\" title=\"68-df-number-theoretic-function\">68-df-number-theoretic-function</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{e,s}^{D}\">\\(\\Phi_{e,s}^{D}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"124259d2584af1b6\" href=\"?note=124259d2584af1b6\" title=\"68-df-oracle-computation\">68-df-oracle-computation</a>，查询界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_s(e,D,x)\">\\(u_s(e,D,x)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"31939e9d65c515ab\" href=\"?note=31939e9d65c515ab\" title=\"68-df-finite-use-preservation\">68-df-finite-use-preservation</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_D\">\\(\\chi_D\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7fc8baae87b873a3\" href=\"?note=7fc8baae87b873a3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-set\">68-df-recursive-set</a>。</p>\n<p>以下按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 递归定义本条专用状态序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C_s,b_s,w_s,r_s,d_s)\">\\((C_s,b_s,w_s,r_s,d_s)\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_s\">\\(C_s\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，两项均为有限自然数集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_s\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(b_s\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_s,r_s\\in\\mathbb N^s\">\\(w_s,r_s\\in\\mathbb N^s\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_s\\in\\{0,1\\}^s\">\\(d_s\\in\\{0,1\\}^s\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_s(0)\">\\(C_s(0)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_s(1)\">\\(C_s(1)\\)</span> 是两个集合的阶段；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_s(i)=0\">\\(w_s(i)=0\\)</span> 是未分配标记，正值编码见证加一；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_s(i)\">\\(r_s(i)\\)</span> 为查询限制，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_s(i)\">\\(d_s(i)\\)</span> 为本次初始化以来的行动标记。</p>\n<p>每个阶段先补入第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 个策略，再按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i=0,\\ldots,s\">\\(i=0,\\ldots,s\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_{s,i}\">\\(b_{s,i}\\)</span> 作有限递归；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_s^+,x_{s,\\cdot},\\bar w_s,\\bar r_s,\\bar d_s\">\\(w_s^+,x_{s,\\cdot},\\bar w_s,\\bar r_s,\\bar d_s\\)</span> 的定义域均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+1\">\\(s+1\\)</span>。所有含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 的阶段更新方程限于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\le s\">\\(i\\le s\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j_s\\in s+2\">\\(j_s\\in s+2\\)</span>，值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+1\">\\(s+1\\)</span> 为无行动标记。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_{\\mathrm{FM}},\\ell_{\\mathrm{FM}}\">\\(e_{\\mathrm{FM}},\\ell_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FMAct}\">\\(\\mathrm{FMAct}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FMStage}_{68}\">\\(\\operatorname{FMStage}_{68}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{\\mathrm{FM}},B_{\\mathrm{FM}}\">\\(A_{\\mathrm{FM}},B_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\)</span> 及数值函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_{\\mathrm{FM}},\\beta_{\\mathrm{FM}},\\gamma_{\\mathrm{FM}}\">\\(\\alpha_{\\mathrm{FM}},\\beta_{\\mathrm{FM}},\\gamma_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\)</span> 均由下式引入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"e_{\\mathrm{FM}}(i):=\\max\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:2e\\le i\\},\\qquad\\ell_{\\mathrm{FM}}(i):=i-2e_{\\mathrm{FM}}(i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[e_{\\mathrm{FM}}(i):=\\max\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:2e\\le i\\},\\qquad\\ell_{\\mathrm{FM}}(i):=i-2e_{\\mathrm{FM}}(i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_0:=\\{(0,\\varnothing),(1,\\varnothing)\\},\\qquad b_0:=0,\\qquad w_0:=(),\\qquad r_0:=(),\\qquad d_0:=().\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_0:=\\{(0,\\varnothing),(1,\\varnothing)\\},\\qquad b_0:=0,\\qquad w_0:=(),\\qquad r_0:=(),\\qquad d_0:=().\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bar w_s:=w_s\\,^{\\frown}\\langle0\\rangle,\\qquad\\bar r_s:=r_s\\,^{\\frown}\\langle0\\rangle,\\qquad\\bar d_s:=d_s\\,^{\\frown}\\langle0\\rangle,\\qquad b_{s,0}:=b_s.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bar w_s:=w_s\\,^{\\frown}\\langle0\\rangle,\\qquad\\bar r_s:=r_s\\,^{\\frown}\\langle0\\rangle,\\qquad\\bar d_s:=d_s\\,^{\\frown}\\langle0\\rangle,\\qquad b_{s,0}:=b_s.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"v_{s,i}:=\\max\\bigl(\\{b_{s,i}\\}\\cup\\{\\bar r_s(j)+1:j&lt;i\\}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[v_{s,i}:=\\max\\bigl(\\{b_{s,i}\\}\\cup\\{\\bar r_s(j)+1:j&lt;i\\}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"w_s^+(i):=\\begin{cases}\\bar w_s(i)&amp;\\bar w_s(i)&gt;0,\\\\v_{s,i}+1&amp;\\bar w_s(i)=0,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nb_{s,i+1}:=\\begin{cases}b_{s,i}&amp;\\bar w_s(i)&gt;0,\\\\v_{s,i}+1&amp;\\bar w_s(i)=0.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[w_s^+(i):=\\begin{cases}\\bar w_s(i)&amp;\\bar w_s(i)&gt;0,\\\\v_{s,i}+1&amp;\\bar w_s(i)=0,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nb_{s,i+1}:=\\begin{cases}b_{s,i}&amp;\\bar w_s(i)&gt;0,\\\\v_{s,i}+1&amp;\\bar w_s(i)=0.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x_{s,i}:=w_s^+(i)-1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x_{s,i}:=w_s^+(i)-1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_s:=\\left\\{i\\le s:\\bar d_s(i)=0\\land(x_{s,i},0)\\in\\Phi_{e_{\\mathrm{FM}}(i),s}^{C_s(1-\\ell_{\\mathrm{FM}}(i))}\\right\\},\\qquad\nj_s:=\\min\\bigl(\\mathcal E_s\\cup\\{s+1\\}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal E_s:=\\left\\{i\\le s:\\bar d_s(i)=0\\land(x_{s,i},0)\\in\\Phi_{e_{\\mathrm{FM}}(i),s}^{C_s(1-\\ell_{\\mathrm{FM}}(i))}\\right\\},\\qquad\nj_s:=\\min\\bigl(\\mathcal E_s\\cup\\{s+1\\}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_{s+1}(k):=C_s(k)\\cup\\{x\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists i\\le s\\;(j_s=i\\land\\ell_{\\mathrm{FM}}(i)=k\\land x=x_{s,i})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_{s+1}(k):=C_s(k)\\cup\\{x\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists i\\le s\\;(j_s=i\\land\\ell_{\\mathrm{FM}}(i)=k\\land x=x_{s,i})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"w_{s+1}(i):=\\begin{cases}w_s^+(i)&amp;i\\le j_s,\\\\0&amp;j_s&lt;i,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nr_{s+1}(i):=\\begin{cases}\\bar r_s(i)&amp;i&lt;j_s,\\\\u_s(e_{\\mathrm{FM}}(i),C_s(1-\\ell_{\\mathrm{FM}}(i)),x_{s,i})&amp;i=j_s,\\\\0&amp;j_s&lt;i,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nd_{s+1}(i):=\\begin{cases}\\bar d_s(i)&amp;i&lt;j_s,\\\\1&amp;i=j_s,\\\\0&amp;j_s&lt;i.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[w_{s+1}(i):=\\begin{cases}w_s^+(i)&amp;i\\le j_s,\\\\0&amp;j_s&lt;i,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nr_{s+1}(i):=\\begin{cases}\\bar r_s(i)&amp;i&lt;j_s,\\\\u_s(e_{\\mathrm{FM}}(i),C_s(1-\\ell_{\\mathrm{FM}}(i)),x_{s,i})&amp;i=j_s,\\\\0&amp;j_s&lt;i,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nd_{s+1}(i):=\\begin{cases}\\bar d_s(i)&amp;i&lt;j_s,\\\\1&amp;i=j_s,\\\\0&amp;j_s&lt;i.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"b_{s+1}:=b_{s,s+1},\\qquad\\operatorname{FMStage}_{68}(s):=(C_s,b_s,w_s,r_s,d_s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[b_{s+1}:=b_{s,s+1},\\qquad\\operatorname{FMStage}_{68}(s):=(C_s,b_s,w_s,r_s,d_s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FMAct}(i,s)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;i\\le s\\land j_s=i.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FMAct}(i,s)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;i\\le s\\land j_s=i.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_{\\mathrm{FM}}:=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}C_s(0),\\qquad B_{\\mathrm{FM}}:=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}C_s(1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_{\\mathrm{FM}}:=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}C_s(0),\\qquad B_{\\mathrm{FM}}:=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}C_s(1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_{\\mathrm{FM}}(s,x):=\\chi_{C_s(0)}(x),\\qquad\\beta_{\\mathrm{FM}}(s,x):=\\chi_{C_s(1)}(x),\\qquad\n\\gamma_{\\mathrm{FM}}(s):=\\begin{cases}j_s+1&amp;j_s\\le s,\\\\0&amp;j_s=s+1.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha_{\\mathrm{FM}}(s,x):=\\chi_{C_s(0)}(x),\\qquad\\beta_{\\mathrm{FM}}(s,x):=\\chi_{C_s(1)}(x),\\qquad\n\\gamma_{\\mathrm{FM}}(s):=\\begin{cases}j_s+1&amp;j_s\\le s,\\\\0&amp;j_s=s+1.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此文件只补全原有 Friedberg–Muchnik 构造说明所需的确定性阶段接口，没有增加另一种优先方法。偶策略以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_s(1)\">\\(C_s(1)\\)</span> 为 oracle，对角化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_s(0)\">\\(C_s(0)\\)</span>；奇策略交换两者。每阶段按最小策略编号选择一个行动者；行动后较低策略的见证、限制和行动标记同时初始化。</p>\n<p>有界分配递归先确定第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 个见证，再确定下一个可用数，因此没有阶段内部的循环定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_s\">\\(b_s\\)</span> 始终严格高于此前分配过的全部实际见证；新见证还严格高于当前较高策略的限制。即使一个新见证在同阶段被初始化丢弃，也不会再用。所有 max 的候选集包含一个指定自然数；min 的候选集包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+1\">\\(s+1\\)</span>。因此空集合、无行动和无 oracle 查询均有确定分支。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_s^+\">\\(w_s^+\\)</span> 的值总为正，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_{s,i}\">\\(x_{s,i}\\)</span> 的减一合法；输出状态的三个序列长度均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+1\">\\(s+1\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>每个状态仅含有限数据，集合只通过加入一个见证变化；oracle 阶段计算查询的是已明确给出的有限集合。阶段可计算性、有限行动及最终对角要求由下游构造定理陈述和验证。这里并未先假设构造成功，也没有把成功条件作为阶段递归的前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-number-theoretic-function","status":"resolved","id":"c524671590651be2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","locat