sive-set","status":"resolved","id":"7fc8baae87b873a3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s,i,x\\in\\mathbb N$，$k\\in\\{0,1\\}$。有限序列及连接见 [[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]，$\\Phi_{e,s}^{D}$ 见 [[68-df-oracle-computation]]，查询界 $u_s(e,D,x)$ 见 [[68-df-finite-use-preservation]]，$\\chi_D$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-set]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s,i,x\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_{e,s}^{D}","display":false},{"tex":"u_s(e,D,x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_D","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"(C_s,b_s,w_s,r_s,d_s)","display":false},{"tex":"C_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"b_s\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"w_s,r_s\\in\\mathbb N^s","display":false},{"tex":"d_s\\in\\{0,1\\}^s","display":false},{"tex":"C_s(0)","display":false},{"tex":"C_s(1)","display":false},{"tex":"w_s(i)=0","display":false},{"tex":"r_s(i)","display":false},{"tex":"d_s(i)","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"i=0,\\ldots,s","display":false},{"tex":"b_{s,i}","display":false},{"tex":"w_s^+,x_{s,\\cdot},\\bar w_s,\\bar r_s,\\bar d_s","display":false},{"tex":"s+1","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"i\\le s","display":false},{"tex":"j_s\\in s+2","display":false},{"tex":"s+1","display":false},{"tex":"e_{\\mathrm{FM}},\\ell_{\\mathrm{FM}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FMAct}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FMStage}_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"A_{\\mathrm{FM}},B_{\\mathrm{FM}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha_{\\mathrm{FM}},\\beta_{\\mathrm{FM}},\\gamma_{\\mathrm{FM}}","display":false},{"tex":"e_{\\mathrm{FM}}(i):=\\max\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:2e\\le i\\},\\qquad\\ell_{\\mathrm{FM}}(i):=i-2e_{\\mathrm{FM}}(i).","display":true},{"tex":"C_0:=\\{(0,\\varnothing),(1,\\varnothing)\\},\\qquad b_0:=0,\\qquad w_0:=(),\\qquad r_0:=(),\\qquad d_0:=().","display":true},{"tex":"\\bar w_s:=w_s\\,^{\\frown}\\la